Package: vci
Title: Vector Control Impact Spatial Modelling
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Nick", "Golding", , "nick.golding.research@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts spatially varying vector biology, environment, human
    behaviour, and intervention scenarios into vectorial capacity and
    vector control impact, the proportional reduction in vectorial
    capacity attributable to a set of interventions. Implements the Vector
    Atlas 'Vector Control Impact' framework, computing vector-side
    transmission potential and its response to control across pixel and
    administrative-area workflows.
